      "items": [
        "Coral reefs are limestone structures constructed by tiny marine organisms known as polyps.",
        "Optimal growth occurs in warm, shallow, and clear tropical waters.",
        "Corals require a stable temperature range of 20–30°C to thrive.",
        "Environmental conditions must include low sedimentation and consistent salinity levels."
